---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Electrical Services — Your Name Electric Central Florida
description: Licensed electrical services in Central Florida including panel upgrades, EV charger installation, whole-home rewiring, outlets, generators, and 24/7 emergency service.
pageTitle: Electrical Services
pageIntro: From a single outlet to a full panel upgrade — licensed, permitted, and inspected work across Central Florida.
eyebrow: What We Do
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">What We Do</span>
    <h1>Electrical Services in {{ site.areaServed }}</h1>
    <p>Licensed residential and commercial electrical work — permitted, inspected, and backed by our workmanship guarantee.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="services-grid">
      {%- for s in services.list %}
      <div id="{{ s.slug }}" class="service-detail-card">
        <div class="service-detail-header">
          <span class="service-detail-num">{{ loop.index | padStart(2, "0") }}</span>
          <span class="service-detail-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ s.icon }}</span>
        </div>
        <h2>{{ s.name }}</h2>
        <p>{{ s.body }}</p>
        <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}" class="btn btn--primary">Request a Quote</a>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
